{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL0luJTIwUmVzdGxlc3MlMjBEcmVhbXMlMjBUaGUlMjBNdXNpYyUyME9mJTIwUGF1bCUyMFNpbW9uJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"In Restless Dreams The Music Of Paul Simon","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7i6vi55sKGJDjOpXJ2oVdmB4ktP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/51pDD95KKbLCleHpudB42ghzaKv.jpg","description":"Chronicles the career of the titular Grammy Award-winning folk-pop singer-songwriter. The documentary also follows Simon’s journey creating his new album, Seven Psalms. The track on the record pose questions about faith and mortality, particularly during the pandemic, and also feature him contending with his hearing loss. Gibney and Simon also journey through a dreamlike world of storytelling that transcends both time and space, as it moves freely between present and past. The movie also offers a unique peek into Simon’s entire career, from Tom & Jerry to Simon & Garfunkel and the triumphs of Graceland and Rhythm of the Saints.\n\nRated PG · Released 2 Aug 2024 · United States of America · Language: English · 219 min\nStudio: Jigsaw Productions, Closer Media, Anonymous Content\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"219 min","cast":["Paul Simon","Art Garfunkel","Wynton Marsalis","Lorne Michaels","Edie Brickell"],"director":["Alex Gibney"],"released":"2024-08-02T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Alex Gibney","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i66xSiaYwo9lgjIZwglrc2bYUG7.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Simon","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vWOVDx7feNDSpgI2njivbCeFvEu.jpg"},{"name":"Art Garfunkel","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sNssWMf5FyPmr0Wt9ZYmMemAqsF.jpg"},{"name":"Wynton Marsalis","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pTllriEqFA458ZcUrYHzZGZk3Ne.jpg"},{"n